{"sections":[{"slug":"Thom类","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Thom类"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Thom <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Thom 类”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\xi\\colon V\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是带定向的向量丛</span>, $\\mathrm {Th}(\\xi)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Thom谱","text":"Thom <span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则有同构</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathrm {Th}(\\xi)\\wedge H\\mathbb{Z} \\simeq X_+ \\wedge H\\mathbb{Z}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong> (Thom) <span lang=\"zh\">对于局部紧空间</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\check H_c^*(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为紧支集</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Čech上同调","text":"Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">定义为</span> $\\operatorname{ker}(H^*(\\dot X) \\to H^*(\\infty))$. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为紧拓扑空间</span>, $V\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是带定向的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维向量丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么存在唯一的上同调类</span> $u_V\\in \\check H_c^n(V)$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得它限制在每个纤维</span> $V_x$ <span lang=\"zh\">上等同于定向类</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且有同构</span>\n$$\r\n\\smile u_V\\colon \\check H_c^i(X)\\to \\check H_c^{i+n}(V).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>Thom <span lang=\"zh\">类在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的限制为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Euler类","text":"Euler <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $V_1$, $V_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">分别为</span> $X_1$, $X_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的向量丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则两个向量丛的外直积的</span> Euler <span lang=\"zh\">类等于各自</span> Euler <span lang=\"zh\">类的积</span>:\n$$\r\nu_{V_1\\times V_2} = u_{V_1} \\smile u_{V_2}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}